#. <CLT 4>ハニワだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Some terra-cotta clay figures...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>体育館の前に飾るものじゃないだろ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They don't look like the kind of thing you'd put in a\n"
"high school gym.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>金の…仏像だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a gold statue of Buddha.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何でこんな物が飾ってあるんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why is something like that on display?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>盾だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A plaque...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なにかの大会の、優勝記念らしい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess it's to commemorate some kind of championship.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>兜がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a helmet of some sort.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何でこんな物が飾ってあるんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why is something like that on display?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…刀？　
#. いや、摸擬刀みたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this...a sword? Oh, no, I think it's just a\n"
"replica.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、すごいセンスだ。
#. 全体にまんべんなく金箔が塗装されている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Still, it's pretty impressive. It's completely covered\n"
"in a gold coating.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うわ…！　ちょっと触っただけでも、
#. 手にベタベタと金箔の塗装が…！
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Jeez! I barely touched it and I got that gold stuff\n"
"all over my hands."
msgstr ""

#. ホントだ、手が汚れちゃいますね。
msgctxt "0013 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Wow, you're right. Your hands are totally gold!"
msgstr ""

#. これじゃあ護身用にしても…
#. ちょっと…
msgctxt "0014 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Even just for self-defense, I think it's a little..."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…ないよりはマシだと思ったけど…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, it's still better than nothing, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、苗木君が持って帰ったらどうですか？
#. 意外なインテリアとして活躍するかもしれませんよ。
msgctxt "0016 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"You should take it with you! It might help liven up\n"
"your room a little."
msgstr ""

#. インテリアに…なるのか？
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、気を付けて持って帰ってくださいね。
#. 新聞紙とかで包んだ方がいいですよ。
msgctxt "0018 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But I guess you'd better be careful taking it back.\n"
"You should wrap it in newspaper or something."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう…持って帰る事になってるんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just like that, it's been decided...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここには…他に護身用になりそうな物は
#. ないですね…
msgctxt "0020 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I don't see anything I could really use for\n"
"self-defense..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…心配しなくても、
#. すぐに必要にはならないよ…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"H-Hey, don't worry about it! It's not like you need it\n"
"right away, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それに…
#. もし、そうなったとしても…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Plus, if anything *were* to happen..."
msgstr ""

#. その時は…ボクが守るからさ……
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "When the time comes...I'll protect you."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君が私を…ですか？
msgctxt "0024 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "You'll...protect me?"
msgstr ""

#. ありがとう…ございます…
msgctxt "0025 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Thank you for saying that..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君が味方になってくれるなら…
#. もう、護身用の武器なんていりませんね。
msgctxt "0026 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"If I've got you on my side, I guess I don't need a\n"
"weapon after all!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんは、そう言って笑った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka giggled as she said that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の不思議な笑顔…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That mysterious smile...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>心が安らいでいく笑顔…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can tell it comes from the heart. It makes me feel\n"
"at ease...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この笑顔を見ていると…
#. 本当になんでも出来るような気になってくる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I look at her, I honestly feel like I can do\n"
"anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、武器探しなんてやめて…
#. せっかくだから、もう少しお話していきましょうか。
msgctxt "0031 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Okay, we can stop looking for a weapon, then. But as\n"
"long as we're here, let's hang out a bit more."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>上段の棚にも、色々な物が置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of stuff on the shelves up above.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう少し、武器になりそうなものを探してみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should keep looking for a good weapon a little while\n"
"longer.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
